  presentationText: Light is fading away from the mystical land of Gensokyo. Reimu
    Hakurei, Shrine Maiden and Protector of this land, heads out to investigate what's
    going on. Her first stop is the Scarlet Devil Mansion, where she suspects the
    vampires might have something to do with it. But first, she must pass the Misty
    Lake on her way there...
